0005,"x":0.02666666966666659},{"y":0.47093023232252118,"w":0.15111110687255858,"h":0.013151400040607109,"text":"-_ considered one","x":0.26000000463779466},{"y":0.48401162772949791,"h":0.013131229634187669,"text":"solution to this problem.","x":0.026666673942635041,"w":0.1977777671813965},{"text":"In the famous experiment, 3_ was first conducted","h":0.019141190198003089,"w":0.40275562286376954,"y":0.49841117097766796,"x":0.026399634903222592},{"y":0.51744186021132932,"w":0.41111110687255858,"h":0.013170384776835631,"text":"at Stanford University in the late 1960s, researchers","x":0.026666673924831699},{"x":0.026525415610037441,"h":0.013522080401985104,"w":0.35804580688476562,"y":0.53045187511527725,"text":"gave small children one marshmallow and 4"},{"text":"to","y":0.53343023288721469,"w":0.028888888359069831,"h":0.0087209296713069984,"x":0.39111111089453915},{"h":0.013241575591418253,"text":"give them another one if they didn't eat it for fifteen","x":0.026666672211868771,"w":0.41111110687255864,"y":0.54489795939468455},{"x":0.026666674298991069,"w":0.40666664123535157,"text":"minutes. Some years later, the authors of the study","y":0.55959183673501256,"h":0.013082582123425501},{"x":0.026666675637794554,"h":0.013219032287597687,"y":0.5741279067411259,"w":0.41111110687255858,"text":"got in touch with the children again and found out"},{"w":0.13333333015441895,"y":0.58720930199306387,"x":0.026666670478346005,"text":"that those who 5","h":0.013198861102668658},{"w":0.2666666603088379,"x":0.16222222762335875,"h":0.013172757674236646,"text":"_their marshmallow were doing","y":0.58857142849888155},{"h":0.011627906487912565,"text":"better at school and work.","x":0.026666666636279254,"y":0.60319767463395069,"w":0.20888889312744141},{"x":0.026666668607828896,"text":"However, a more recent study questions the","y":0.62063953477528289,"w":0.35333332061767575,"h":0.013238016245316508},{"text":"findings of the experiment •","h":0.014534884083027722,"y":0.63372092986982331,"