:0.28278611045583379,"text":"vividly did not, 3","w":0.12703433036804201,"h":0.017276615999182843},{"h":0.011800623134690769,"x":0.7288643528641634,"text":"fact, happen.","w":0.095604629516601647,"y":0.28625085097231318},{"x":0.50888888917514208,"y":0.30087209319486974,"h":0.0087209296713069984,"text":"4","w":0.013333332538604692},{"x":0.61333334411191132,"text":"my aunt not informed me otherwise,","w":0.26888887405395512,"h":0.011836734693877471,"y":0.30367346946017459},{"h":0.013926667193977171,"text":"I would still believe that I personally witnessed our","x":0.50878047990800923,"y":0.31682252910546416,"w":0.38019462585449215},{"text":"house on fire when I was about four. I 5","y":0.32979591837270217,"h":0.011836734693877471,"w":0.29111110687255859,"x":0.51111111778594265},{"y":0.34447674502575554,"w":0.38888889312744146,"h":0.014706928486726722,"text":"still see the picture of the burning house in my mind,","x":0.51111111065850134},{"x":0.51111110502887203,"w":0.38888889312744135,"text":"but I wasn't there! Apparently, I was on holiday with","y":0.35901162752600957,"h":0.013233270450514256},{"h":0.013158519511320188,"y":0.37346938746485048,"x":0.51111111488888883,"w":0.31999999999999995,"text":"my aunt and uncle at the time. People had"},{"text":"me so much about the fire that I had created my own","y":0.38938775493590949,"h":0.011836734693877582,"x":0.51111113027121291,"w":0.38666664123535155},{"text":"memory of it. This has started me wondering how many","w":0.41133155822753908,"x":0.511000083537547,"h":0.014124424214265852,"y":0.40215687480454032},{"y":0.41579093213732499,"x":0.51098200359103785,"w":0.40469234466552739,"text":"more of our early memories are false. A scary thought!","h":0.014982263993243761},{"h":0.010174418079609726,"text":"7","y":0.42877906986038905,"w":0.013333332538604692,"x":0.50888888913810504},{"h":0.015123090160136354,"text":"you check and cross-reference all those","y":0.42973446291551576,"x":0.61089217859536604,"w":0.2936920166015625